<InfoPage title="Our editorial policy." eyebrow="EDITORIAL STANDARDS" intro="Clear research, independent recommendations, and corrections when needed.">
<h2>Editorial independence</h2><p>Commercial relationships should never be the sole reason a product is selected or ranked. Affiliate links are labeled, and any sponsored content must be disclosed separately.</p><h2>Evidence standards</h2><p>Every meaningful product claim should be attributable to testing or a reliable, identifiable source. We avoid invented measurements, specifications and customer sentiment.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Readers can report errors through the contact page once a verified contact address is configured. Updates should include actual changes rather than cosmetic date changes.</p><h2>Scope and limitations</h2><p>Fitness gear advice does not substitute for medical or personal training guidance. Articles may not cover every product in a category and should explain limits on available evidence.</p>
</InfoPage>
